		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2019. Active; focal plane 30 m (98 ft); three white flashes every 15 s. Approx. 27 m (89 ft) round cylindrical concrete tower with lantern and two large observation galleries. A 2020 photo is at right, Suvajit Manna has a good photo, T. Suman has a closeup and a street view, and Google has a satellite view. Located in Tajpur, about 30 km (19 mi) southwest of Contai. Site open, tower open late afternoons daily. . Admiralty F1028.5.</SimpleData>
