		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1979. Active; focal plane 35 m (115 ft); white flash every 15 s. 30 m (98 ft) triangular cylindrical concrete tower with lantern and double gallery, painted with horizontal red and white bands. Khalasi Krunal's 2019 photo is at the top of this page, Vikas Mhaskar has a 2021 photo, Chandni Rajendran has a view from atop the lighthouse, and Google has a satellite view. Umergam Beach is a popular resort, and the lighthouse is an attraction. Located off the beach at Umbergaon. Site open, tower open daily. Operator: DGLL. ARLHS IND-118; Admiralty F0489; NGA 28092.</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-118</SimpleData>
