		<SimpleData name="rowlett">Date unknown. Active; focal plane 13 m (43 ft); white flash every 5 s. 12 m (39 ft) mast. A closeup photo (fifth from last photo on a long page) is available but the mast has not been located in Google's satellite view. NGA lists a skeletal tower. Located on the north side of the entrance to Khongda (Dahanu) Creek at Dahanu, a city of about 80,000 residents. Site open, tower closed. Admiralty F0491; NGA 28088.</SimpleData>
