		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1968. Active; focal plane 37 m (122 ft); white flash every 10 s. 30 m (98 ft) round masonry tower, painted with horizontal red and white bands. Two 1-story keeper's houses. Chandra Shekhar Satti's 2023 photo is at the top of this page, Sangeeta Kumari has a closeup 2011 photo, Subhajit Mishra has a 2016 photo, and Google has a satellite view. This is one three lighthouses in Odisha designated for tourist development in 2011. Located just off the beach near Konarak (Konark). Site open, tower open late afternoons daily. . ARLHS IND-025; Admiralty F1003; NGA 26940.</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-025</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
