		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2012. Active; focal plane 40 m (131 ft); two white flashes every 10 s. 32 m (105 ft) round concrete tower with lantern and gallery, painted with red and white spiral bands. Susanta Patra has a closeup 2020 photo, a 2023 photo is available, Manoj Pradhan has a 2017 photo, and Google has a satellite view. Located on the coast about 25 km (15 mi) northeast of Ganjam. Site open, tower status unknown. Admiralty F1000; NGA 26946.</SimpleData>
