		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(5:Elevation given as 'Elevation of ground 8.1 m' and 'Elevation of tower 38.1 m'; 38.1 m used,Divergence printed '2.40 (Horiz.) &amp; 1.15 (Vert.)' without units; taken as degrees,No date of commissioning given (only innovation August 2013),3 panels at 3 RPM does not obviously match GR FL (2) every 10 sec,Intensity labelled 'Luminous Intensity' rather than effective beam intensity)</SimpleData>
