		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1955. Active; focal plane 33 m (108 ft); white flash every 3 s. 16 m (52 ft) square cylindrical masonry tower with lantern and gallery, attached to the front of a 2-story masonry keeper's house. Tower painted with black and white horizontal bands; lantern dome painted red. Ketan Kadam's 2024 photo is below right, Harshal Sonawane has a 2019 photo, Mithila Rane has a photo, Vinit Maheshwari has a 2007 photo, Siddhesh Balsaraf has a street view, and Google has a satellite view and a fuzzy street view. Ruins of the early 16th century Korlai fort, built in a successful campaign to expel the Portuguese from Chaul, are on the hill above the lighthouse; a long stairway connects the fort and the lig</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-081</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="photo">https://www.dgll.nic.in/sites/default/files/2022-11/Korlai%20Fort%20Lighthouse.jpg</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
