		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2021. Active; focal plane 57 m (187 ft); white flash every 15 s. Approx. 25 m (82 ft) octagonal concrete tower wih a large lantern structure, painted with black and white horizontal bands. Suraj Sheth's 2023 photo is at right, Danish Palte has a December 2020 photo of the lighthouse under construction, Pramod Jadhav has a May 2022 photo of the completed lighthouse, and Google has a 2023 street view and a satellite view. Located on a prominent headland at Dapoli. Site open, tower closed. Admiralty F0563.5.</SimpleData>
