		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1957. Active; focal plane 18 m (59 ft); white flash every 15 s. 18 m (59 ft) square cylindrical stone tower with lantern and gallery, painted with horizontal black and white bands; lantern dome painted red. Guduguntla Karthik has a 2017 photo, Raju Boddapu has a 2022 photo, and Google has a satellite view. Located at Pentakota, about 12 km (7.5 mi) southeast of Tuni and 40 km (25 mi) north of Kakinada. Site and tower status unknown. ARLHS IND-051; Admiralty F0966; NGA 27016.</SimpleData>
