		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(3:No. of panels given as '4 (2 group of 2)',Duration of flash stated 0.41 s while sequence gives FL0.4,Year of first light 1971 but Date of Commissioning 15/12/1984)</SimpleData>
