		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(2:Luminous range printed as '24 M at 074 ATF' (unit unclear),4 panels of 90° each at 1 RPM does not obviously produce Gp Fl(2) every 15 s)</SimpleData>
