		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(3:Characteristic sequence 'Fl 11.16+03.84' conflicts with stated duration of flash 1.16 seconds,No. of panels printed '4 log of 90° each',Year first light commissioned 1901; date of commissioning 17-09-1998)</SimpleData>
