		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1976. Active; focal plane 66 m (217 ft); three white flashes every 10 s. Approx. 10 m (33 ft) sqaure tower painted with black and white horizontal bands. DGLL has a photo and Google has an indistinct satellite view. Rushikesh Bongarde has a 2022 closeup photo of a concrete pillar that probably carried an earlier light. In 2016 DGLL called for bids on a project of &quot;improvements&quot; at this lighthouse. Located on an island in the entrance to the bay of Belekeri. Accessible only by boat. Site status unknown. Admiralty F0637; NGA 27748.</SimpleData>
