		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2003 (station established 1938). Active; focal plane 36 m (118 ft); three white flashes every 15 s. 30 m (98 ft) hexagonal masonry tower with lantern and gallery, painted with horizontal black and white bands. Vijay Kanth posted a 2020 photo and Google has a street view and a satellite view. Located about 5 km (3 mi) north of the harbor at Krishnapatnam, a former fishing village where private interests have developed port facilities, about 40 km (25 mi) southeast of Nellore. Accessible by road. Site open, tower closed. ARLHS IND-040; Admiralty F0952; NGA 27060.</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-040</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="wikidata">Q57537759</SimpleData>
