		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(3:Duration of flash 2.5 Sec in a 3 sec period (flash longer than eclipse),RACON Sr. No 6295 listed but all RACON details blank,Commissioning 1901 with subsequent innovations 1973, 2012)</SimpleData>
