		<SimpleData name="page_url">https://www.dgll.nic.in/DGLL-light-house-location/about-chennai/cuddalore-lighthouse</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1890 (British). Active; focal plane 13 m (43 ft); three white flashes every 10 s. 16 m (52 ft) round cylindrical tower with lantern and gallery. Lighthouse painted white; lantern dome is red. Chandru Sekar has the 2021 photo seen at right, a 2018 photo is available, P.J. Sinna has a 2011 photo, and Google has a satellite view. This historic lighthouse and the Kodikkaraik lighthouse mark the northern entrance to Palk Bay. Located on Calimere Point, about 60 km (37.5 mi) south of Nagappattinam. Site open, tower status unknown. ARLHS IND-024; Admiralty F0910; NGA 27144.</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-024</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="photo">https://www.dgll.nic.in/sites/default/files/2022-11/dg6.jpg</SimpleData>
