		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(5:Duration of Flash given as '15 Sec', same as the period; not transcribed as flash_duration_s,Intensity printed as '10,3000 Cdls' (irregular digit grouping), read as 103000,NAIS MMSI printed as '88' (implausible),6 lenses at 4 RPM does not match a single flash every 15 s unless panels are blanked; not stated,Emergency light: Halogen Lamp 100 watts / 12 V DC (Drum Optic))</SimpleData>
