		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2018 (station established 1984). Active; focal plane 34 m (112 ft); white flash every 5 s. 30 m (98 ft) square galvanized iron skeletal tower, painted with black and white horizontal bands; there is a 1-story concrete equipment room inside the base. A 2022 photo is available, Muhammed Hussain's 2020 photo shows both towers side by side and Google has an indistinct satellite view. Located near the southern tip of the island. Site open, tower closed. Admiralty F0754.4; NGA 27596.</SimpleData>
