		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2015 (?) (station established 1993). Active; focal plane 24 m (79 ft); white flash every 5 s. Approx. 22 m (72 ft) square masonry tower. Fasweeh Ullisan's 2021 photo is at right, Sangeeth Mohan has a 2025 photo, Ankur Saraf has a 2023 photo, Saakshi Gulati has a view from the sea, and Google has an indistinct satellite view. The original light was on a 12 m (39 ft) square galvanized iron skeletal tower, painted white. Thinnakara is an atoll a few miles north of Agatti; boat transportation from Agatti can be arranged. Site open, tower closed. Admiralty F0754.6; NGA 27598.</SimpleData>
