		<SimpleData name="transcribed">1</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(3:Page 1 is a cover page; no station name header, name taken from postal address,RACON section gives Sr. No 6295 but Make 'NA' (same serial appears in other ledgers),ALOL printed '0692' without letter prefix)</SimpleData>
