		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2010. Active; focal plane unknown; four white flashes every 15 s. 30 m (98 ft) octagonal cylindrical concrete tower with lantern, gallery, and an octagonal observation level below the lantern. Lighthouse painted with red and white vertical stripes. A 2022 photo ia available, Wikimedia has a good 2015 photo, Peer Mohamed has a 2016 closeup photo, Pagu Pandian has a 2011 photo, a street view from the gallery is available, and Google has a satellite view. The light is listed as &quot;Pumpukar&quot; by NGA. Located near Kaveripatnam, about 30 km (19 mi) north of Karaikal. Site open, tower open 3 to 6 pm daily. Admiralty F0918: NGA 27134.</SimpleData>
