		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1979. Active; focal plane 35 m (115 ft); white flash every 15 s. 30 m (98 ft) hexagonal concrete tower with lantern and double gallery, painted with horizontal red and white bands. Nithish Shajan has a 2022 photo, Waleed Maraika has a 2016 photo, Mohamed Anas has view from the bay, Hanees Karattu has a street view, and Google has a satellite view. Located at Kilakarai, on the northern shore of the Gulf of Mannar about 16 km (10 mi) south of Ramanathapuram. Site open, tower closed. ARLHS IND-038; Admiralty F0738; NGA 27172.</SimpleData>
