		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2022. Active; focal plane about 52 m (171 ft); white light, pattern unknown. 49 m (161 ft) octagonal concrete tower centered on a 2-story building and carrying a large octagonal observation room. Tower and observation room painted in a red and white checkerboard pattern. Ritesh Kejriwal has a April 2022 photo, and Google has the 2023 street view seen at right and a satellite view. The lighthouse was inaugurated in May 2022. Its navigational purpose is unclear but it marks an extremity of Indian terrirory. Located near the end of the Indian portion of Adam's Bridge, a well known tourist attraction. Site status open, tower closed. Admiralty F0908.</SimpleData>
