		<SimpleData name="rowlett">2016. Active; focal plane 30 m (98 ft); three white flashes every 10 s. 30 m (98 ft) octagonal concrete tower with lantern and gallery, painted with black and white horizontal bands. Cyril Xavier has a photo, a 2017 photo is available, Siva Sankar has a 2020 photo, Dhananjay Singh has a distant street view, and Google has a satellite view. Located just off the beach at Vembar, a fishing village at the northern border of the Thoothukudi District. Site open, tower closed. Admiralty F0737.</SimpleData>
