		<SimpleData name="ledger_issues">(3:Elevation given as '43 mt. (Base to Vane)' and '38 mt. (Base to light beam)', not above MSL; 38 m used,Characteristic does not state the light colour,Optic type printed as '2rd Order')</SimpleData>
