		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1979 (station established 1845). Active; focal plane 48 m (157 ft); white flash every 10 s. Approx. 40 m (131 ft) round cylindrical tower with lantern and double gallery, painted with black and white spiral bands. Anitto Sylvester's 2022 photo is at right, a 2025 photo is available, Satheeshkannan Satheeshkannan has a 2017 photo, a distant view is available, and Google has a good satellite view. The first light at this station was shown from a flag post; this was replaced by an 11 m (36 ft) masonry obelisk and then by the 1935 lighthouse. Located on an island (tivu) protecting the harbor of Thoothukudi (Tuticorin). The island is connected to the mainland by a causeway and the lighthouse is a</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="arlhs">IND-062</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="wikidata">Q141320843</SimpleData>
