		<SimpleData name="rowlett">1986. Active; focal plane 53 m (174 ft); white flash every 15 s. 12 m (39 ft) square steel skeletal tower with gallery and an enclosed equipment shelter in the base. Lighthouse painted white. A distant aerial view is available and Google has a satellite view. Pulomilo is a small island just off the northwestern tip of Little Nicobar Island. Located on the highest point of the island. Accessible only by boat. Site open, tower closed. ARLHS AND-014; Admiralty F1223.6; NGA 26440.</SimpleData>
